// currently: base rejected (subgoals=8 matches=581): no coercion from '(P<A>, P<(A::P).X>) ==> [Void]() let -> Void' to '[Void]() let -> Void'; FULL rejected (subgoals=4 matches=147): no coercion from '(P<A>, P<(A::P).X>) ==> [Void]() let -> Void' to '[Void]() let -> Void'
